WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.215 --> 00:00:01.930
(bright electronic music)

00:00:01.930 --> 00:00:05.320
- [Narrator] Hong Kong is
Cantonese for "fragrant harbor."

00:00:05.320 --> 00:00:09.310
And the scent that defines
this city is incense.

00:00:09.310 --> 00:00:13.175
One of the rarest kinds has
one very special ingredient.

00:00:13.175 --> 00:00:16.092
(foreign language)

00:00:25.840 --> 00:00:28.840
This Great Big Story is inspired by ...

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:30.389
Genesis.

00:00:30.389 --> 00:00:33.889
(bright electronic music)

00:00:38.620 --> 00:00:41.537
(foreign language)

00:00:44.574 --> 00:00:46.970
Wah Yuen has one of the
last shops in Hong Kong

00:00:46.970 --> 00:00:49.094
that hand rolls incense from agarwood.

00:00:49.094 --> 00:00:52.011
(foreign language)

00:01:03.401 --> 00:01:07.130
Agarwood incense smells like
nutty wood and sweet vanilla.

00:01:07.130 --> 00:01:09.010
But this scent is expensive.

00:01:09.010 --> 00:01:11.290
About one pound of quality agarwood

00:01:11.290 --> 00:01:13.810
could cost over $60,000.

00:01:13.810 --> 00:01:17.123
And a high quality pice of
agarwood is hard to find.

00:01:20.696 --> 00:01:23.540
(gentle music)

00:01:23.540 --> 00:01:26.560
Agarwood is created
out of aquilaria trees.

00:01:26.560 --> 00:01:29.270
But when the tree is
healthy, it is odorless.

00:01:29.270 --> 00:01:30.660
The scent comes from an oil

00:01:30.660 --> 00:01:33.152
that is emitted when the tree is damaged.

00:01:33.152 --> 00:01:36.069
(foreign language)

00:01:40.670 --> 00:01:42.990
While today many people rely on factories

00:01:42.990 --> 00:01:45.740
for incense production,
it is Wah Yuen's hope

00:01:45.740 --> 00:01:48.370
that the traditional way
of hand rolling agarwood

00:01:48.370 --> 00:01:50.743
is passed on to future generations.

00:01:52.432 --> 00:01:55.058
(soft music)

00:01:55.058 --> 00:01:57.975
(foreign language)

